tions#Resupply a customer managed key#Before you begin":[372,377],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Before you begin#{1}":[374,377],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure":[378,399],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{1}":[380,381],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{2}":[382,383],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{3}":[384,385],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{4}":[386,387],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{5}":[388,389],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{6}":[390,391],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{7}":[392,393],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{8}":[394,395],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{9}":[396,397],"#Key management operations#Resupply a customer managed key#Procedure#{10}":[398,399],"#Key management operations#Related":[400,407],"#Key management operations#Related#{1}":[402,402],"#Key management operations#Related#{2}":[403,403],"#Key management operations#Related#{3}":[404,404],"#Key management operations#Related#{4}":[405,405],"#Key management operations#Related#{5}":[406,407]},"outlinks":[{"title":"encryption","target":"encryption-landing","line":23},{"title":"Rotate a ServiceNow managed key","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-operations-ce.md","line":33},{"title":"Rotate a customer managed key","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-operations-ce.md","line":33},{"title":"Cloud Encryption with Key Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/dare-overview.md","line":37},{"title":"Rotate a customer managed key","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-operations-ce.md","line":47},{"title":"Key Management Framework key life-cycle states","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/key-life-cycle-states.md","line":71},{"title":"Key Management Transactions","target":"key-mgmt-transactions-ce","line":75},{"title":"Key management transactions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-transactions-ce.md","line":77},{"title":"request","target":"c_requestAPI","line":212},{"title":"Key management transactions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-transactions-ce.md","line":212},{"title":"Prepare your customer managed key","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-operations-ce.md","line":227},{"title":"users","target":"users","line":314},{"title":"KB1247113","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1247113","line":322},{"title":"Manage Quorum Control","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/quorum-ctrl-mgmt.md","line":365},{"title":"Quorum Control Policy","target":"quorum-ctrl-policy","line":365},{"title":"Prepare your customer managed key","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-operations-ce.md","line":392},{"title":"Encryption","target":"encryption-landing","line":402},{"title":"Key management transactions","target":"key-mgmt-transactions-ce","line":403},{"title":"request","target":"c_requestAPI","line":404},{"title":"Users","target":"users","line":405},{"title":"Quorum Control Policy","target":"quorum-ctrl-policy","line":406}],"metadata":{"title":"Key management operations","description":"The Key Management Operations submodule provides access to view and manage all encryption keys used with ServiceNow Cloud Encryption.Rotate the active Cloud Encryption ServiceNow managed key.Follow these steps to prepare your customer managed key for upload to your instance.Switch between customer-managed key or a ServiceNow managed keys for use in ServiceNow Cloud Encryption.Rotate your customer managed key to your instance after you’ve wrapped your customer managed key for Cloud Encryption.Use your customer managed key for ServiceNow Cloud Encryption.Switch from a customer managed key back to a managed key for ServiceNow Cloud Encryption.Set a schedule for automatic rotation of your ServiceNow managed keys. This process automatically retires an encryption key and replaces the old key with a newly generated cryptographic key. If you're using a customer managed key, this schedule can provide a reminder to rotate your custom keys manually.After the customer managed key withdrawal functionality is activated, a withdrawal operation becomes available in the Key Management Operations page. Withdraw key and quorum approval operations can also be managed.After a key withdrawal operation has completed, your customer managed key must be resupplied into your instance.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-security/cloud-encryption/key-mgmt-operations-ce.html","release":"australia","product":"Cloud Encryption","classification":"cloud-encryption","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":13,"breadcrumb":["Cloud Encryption with Key Management","Encryption"],"tags":["#platform-security","#cloud-encryption","#kms","#keys","#